{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-mykonos-lagoons","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"mykonos-lagoons-in-golf-city","about":"Mykonos Lagoons - a luxury collection of 4-5 bedroom townhouses, part of the Damac Lagoons project by developer Damac Properties. The design of the complex is inspired by the aesthetics of the Mediterranean resort, with each residence resembling homes from the Greek island of Mykonos. The interiors of the residences feature high quality materials and thoughtful layouts with spacious and cozy rooms.Residents can find a large number of amenities within walking distance of the townhouses. Nearby there are sandy beaches, swimming pools, water attractions, a cinema on the water, various cafes, restaurants, kindergartens, schools and shopping and entertainment centers. Entertainment, educational and medical facilities are also located in the neighboring areas.Due to its close proximity to Dubai's key highways, residents have quick access to key points in the city. Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah and Dubai International Airport are all within a 20-minute drive.Mykonos Lagoons is geared towards couples with children, but is also suitable for those looking for a serene and comfortable life in relative proximity to the epicenter of the city's hustle and bustle.","price":2935000,"title":"Mykonos Lagoons","bitrix":{"id":424,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Damac Lagoons","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Damac Lagoons","property_type":"Townhouses","developer_name":"DAMAC Properties","project_location":"Damac Lagoons"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/86/images/2024/01/05/340x252/mE5NicdkJXMqAoUP57twK1qPE8mDKfmkqgR7JkyF.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/86/images/2024/01/05/464x312/mE5NicdkJXMqAoUP57twK1qPE8mDKfmkqgR7JkyF.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0077645,"lng":55.219314}